---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title='Multi-tenant B2B SaaS architecture | Marcelo Ojeda';
const description='Architecture story: designing and building a multi-tenant B2B SaaS platform from scratch with Java, Spring Boot, React and Google Cloud Platform.';
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} lang="en">
<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Architecture Story · 02</p><h1>Design SaaS as a product, not a collection of parts.</h1><p class="lead">Architecture and implementation of a multi-tenant B2B platform from scratch, spanning domain modeling, security, APIs, web experience, cloud and product decisions.</p></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">Challenge</p><h2>Turn a complex domain into evolvable software.</h2><div class="split"><div class="panel"><h3>Product</h3><p>The platform models risk management, compliance and operational control processes for organizations with different structures and needs.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Architecture</h3><p>The solution needed tenant separation, domain rules, role-based access and functional evolution without becoming a collection of customer-specific implementations.</p></div></div></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">Conceptual view</p><h2>Layers with clear responsibilities.</h2><div class="architecture-canvas saas-canvas" role="img" aria-label="Multi-tenant SaaS architecture"><div class="layer"><small>Experience</small><strong>Web application</strong><span>React · workflows</span></div><div class="route">↓</div><div class="layer boundary"><small>Trust boundary</small><strong>API & access</strong><span>REST · authentication · authorization</span></div><div class="route">↓</div><div class="domain"><small>Product core</small><strong>Multi-tenant domain</strong><span>Business rules · modules · tenant context</span><div class="tenants"><i>Tenant A</i><i>Tenant B</i><i>Tenant …</i></div></div><div class="route">↓</div><div class="bottom"><div class="layer"><small>Data</small><strong>Organization-scoped persistence</strong></div><div class="layer"><small>Platform</small><strong>Google Cloud</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">Decisions</p><h2>Architecture and product evolve together.</h2><div class="cards"><div class="card"><h3>Multi-tenancy</h3><p>Organization isolation is part of the product model from the beginning rather than a later customization.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Domain</h3><p>Modeling of processes, organizational structures, people, risks and controls with a domain-oriented approach.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Security</h3><p>Role-based authentication and authorization integrated into product flows and APIs.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Cloud</h3><p>Operation on Google Cloud Platform with an architecture designed for a maintainable and deployable web product.</p></div></div><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Java</span><span class="tag">Spring Boot</span><span class="tag">React</span><span class="tag">REST APIs</span><span class="tag">Multi-tenant</span><span class="tag">GCP</span></div></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">My role</p><p class="lead">Software Architect and co-founder: architecture design, backend and frontend development, domain modeling, security, technical standards, cloud operations and participation in roadmap and product decisions.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/en/">← Back home</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.architecture-canvas{max-width:900px;margin:3rem 0;padding:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2.5rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 48%,rgba(115,167,255,.1),transparent 45%),rgba(255,255,255,.015);box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}.layer,.domain{padding:1.15rem 1.4rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035)}.layer small,.domain small{display:block;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:.58rem;font-weight:800}.layer strong,.domain strong{display:block;font-size:1.15rem;margin:.18rem 0}.layer span,.domain span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}.boundary{border-style:dashed;border-color:rgba(115,167,255,.38)}.domain{background:linear-gradient(110deg,rgba(115,167,255,.13),rgba(139,92,246,.08));border-color:rgba(115,167,255,.45)}.route{text-align:center;color:var(--accent);height:38px;line-height:38px}.tenants{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.6rem;margin-top:1rem}.tenants i{font-style:normal;text-align:center;padding:.55rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:10px;color:#c5d2df;font-size:.68rem}.bottom{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.75rem}@media(max-width:700px){.tenants,.bottom{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>